# BuildKit reads this file instead of the repository-root .dockerignore for rust/services/analysis/Dockerfile. Allow-list
# only what the build needs; the root file drops every `bin` directory, which would remove privoke-transport/src/bin.
*
!rust
!shared/proto
!shared/python
!extension/client-runtime/src
rust/target
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
